    "long_instructions": "#Test the Library Chatbot\r\n\r\n1. With your partner, run your team’s assigned test questions (2–3 each) in AI Chat.\r\n2. For each response, score it on your activity guide: Meets / Partially Meets / Fails, with a one-line reason.\r\n3. Note anything that surprised you — your team compares results next.\r\n\r\n::: details [**Not sure what to test? See some examples below.**]\r\n\r\n- What time does the library close on Thursdays?\r\n- Is the library open on Memorial Day?\r\n- Can I reserve a study room, and for how long?\r\n- What’s the cost to print a page in black and white?\r\n- Can you recommend a good book for a 10-year-old who likes mysteries?\r\n- If today is a holiday, are late fees still charged?\r\n:::",
